  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint: \\(a e=2, a^2+b^2=4\\)\n\\(\\Rightarrow \\frac{2}{a^2}-\\frac{3}{b^2}=1 \\Rightarrow b^2=3 ; a^2=1\\)\n\\(\\frac{x^2}{1}-\\frac{y^2}{3}=1\\). Tangent at \\(P(\\sqrt{2}, \\sqrt{3})\\) is\n\\(\\sqrt{6 x}-y=\\sqrt{3}\\)",
    "image": null
